#: includes/class-opace-eseot-help.php:194
msgid "Nothing about your pages leaves this site. The audit runs in your own browser against a page served by your own site, the two engines are bundled with the plugin, and the crawl check is your server requesting its own pages. A third-party service only sees an address when you click a deeper check."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-opace-eseot-help.php:195
msgid "Settings live in WordPress options. The only thing kept per page is a short summary of the counts, top Review labels and metrics; full results are never stored. Deleting the plugin removes all of it."
msgstr ""

