msgstr ""

#: includes/class-opace-eseot-help.php:822
msgid "Crawl check unavailable"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-opace-eseot-help.php:823
msgid "The server could not request its own address. Some hosts block loopback requests, or the site host name does not resolve from inside the server. The rest of the audit is unaffected. Ask your host to allow HTTP requests from the site to itself; the same limit also affects WP-Cron and the Site Health loopback test."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-opace-eseot-help.php:826
msgid "The panel is squashed in the block editor"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-opace-eseot-help.php:827
msgid "The block editor keeps meta boxes in a drawer below the content and remembers the height you drag it to. Drag the top edge of the drawer upwards to give the panel room, or click Run a page audit in the sidebar launcher, which opens the drawer and scrolls to the panel."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-opace-eseot-help.php:830
msgid "Results differ from the Chrome extension or PageSpeed Insights"
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-opace-eseot-help.php:831
msgid "The page is audited in a hidden frame while you are logged in, so timings and layout shift differ from a clean visit. PageSpeed Insights reports Google lab and field data, not one visit from your browser."
